                "text": ":earth_africa: Today, we unveil our new identity, new voice, and new website!\n\nThis #rebranding and #repositioning project has been as thrilling as it was complex — and I couldn’t be prouder of what our team has achieved:\n\n:sparkles: Merged 4 solutions and 6 verticals into a single, cohesive product offering\n:sparkles: Unified 11 siloed websites across 6 countries into one digital, global home\n:sparkles: Crafted a clear value proposition and bold tagline that capture our noble mission\n:sparkles: Introduced a beautiful new logo and brand identity, symbolizing the alliance of technology and customer-centricity\n\n“Amplify your impact” — more than a tagline, it marks the beginning of an exciting new chapter at Eudonet.\n\n:bulb: A big thank you and congratulations to the incredible team and our partners who made this milestone possible!\n\nRenaud Sibel Willy Bellony :bulb: Ophélie LE GRAND Sarah Kasmi Calin Frant Maxine Hospel Vladimir COET Nathan Michaux Mélyne F. Inès Coyras Camille Dechartres Sylvain You Samantha Brunel Ferdinand Blanchard Laurent Malpeli Marc THEVENIN Franck Amiot Hortense DESVILLES Luc Xavier Trimouille Michaël Novic Guido van Osch Hermann Ano",
